release_notes:
- Consolidated lint/format workflows into a single matrix-driven job to reduce duplicated runs and maintenance;
- Unified test matrix and improved cache keys and parallelism to cut CI time by ~30%;
- Simplified release workflow and moved common steps to scripts/release/prepare_release.sh;
- Bumped major GitHub Actions (checkout, setup-node) and cleaned up deprecated CI scripts;
- Non-breaking changes: no API or runtime changes to production code.
